<title>SPAIN: EIB to issue 7-pct 10-yr 40 bln pta Matador.</title>
<headline>EIB to issue 7-pct 10-yr 40 bln pta Matador.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Investment Bank is issuing a seven percent 10-year 40 billion peseta Matador with an issue price of par, said the global coordinator and director of the issue Caja Madrid.</p>
<p>Banco Santander and Banco Central Hispano are taking part as co-directors, the statement said.</p>
<p>The issue is directed especially at small investors, it said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
